    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaotic world of <i>Shattered Time</i>, a 2.5D platformer set within the mysterious confines of a high-tech laboratory. As a lone experiment gone awry, you gain the ability to manipulate time itself, allowing you to reverse moments in the environment and use the past to reshape the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the lab\u2019s intricate rooms filled with complex puzzles, dangerous machinery, and shifting platforms. Each challenge requires you to rewind time strategically\u2014whether it's restoring broken pathways, solving mechanical puzzles, or avoiding deadly traps. Time becomes your most powerful tool, but it\u2019s not without its limits. <i>Shattered Time</i> immerses you in a world of science, precision, and danger, where every decision to reverse time can change the way you interact with your environment. Think ahead, experiment with the flow of time, and use your newfound powers to solve puzzles in innovative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Shattered Time</i>, it's not about the story\u2014it's about mastering time itself to escape a high-tech nightmare. Can you put the pieces back together and find your way out? The clock is ticking, and time is in your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rewind Time Itself!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493590/extras/b5b358d20cd9c972a2a95a4c6d89f61d.poster.avif?t=1744220491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493590/extras/b5b358d20cd9c972a2a95a4c6d89f61d.webm?t=1744220491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493590/extras/b5b358d20cd9c972a2a95a4c6d89f61d.mp4?t=1744220491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" 